  "goodToKnow": "Das Heimatland is one's home country or homeland: in sein Heimatland zurückkehren. It's warmer and more personal than das Herkunftsland (country of origin), the neutral official term. Die Heimat carries strong emotion in German: belonging, landscape, childhood; Heimweh is homesickness. Many Germans with migrant roots describe having two Heimaten. Plural: die Heimatländer."
